  "title": "Homemade Cream of Asparagus Soup",
  "description": "You'll never choose canned cream of asparagus again after tasting this rich, creamy, homemade version made in just 45 minutes with fresh asparagus and Marsala wine.",
  "authors": [
    "Dan Toomey"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-03-29T08:42:26-04:00",
